---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="The terms and conditions that govern your use of Citizenship Hub, a project by Built Brilliant."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <nav class="mb-4 text-sm text-slate-500" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="transition hover:text-slate-900">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="mx-1.5 text-slate-300">·</span>
      <span class="text-slate-700">Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
      Terms &amp; Conditions
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">1. Ownership</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Citizenship Hub ("the Site") is a project owned and operated by{' '}
          <a
            href="https://builtbrilliant.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="font-medium text-brand-700 underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
          >
            Built Brilliant
          </a>
          . Throughout these terms, "we", "us", and "our" refer to Built Brilliant.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">2. Informational use only</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The Site provides passport rankings, visa-mobility information, and citizenship guides for general
          informational purposes only. Nothing on the Site constitutes legal, immigration, tax, investment, or travel
          advice.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Requirements, rules, scores, and fees change frequently and vary by individual circumstances. Always verify
          information with the relevant official government source or a qualified professional before relying on it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">3. Third-party data and content</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The Site draws on data and content from multiple public and third-party sources, each subject to its own
          license and terms. Attribution and license details are shown on each country page. We do not claim ownership
          of third-party data, which is provided "as is".
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">4. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The Site's design, text, code, and original content are the property of Built Brilliant or its licensors and
          are protected by applicable intellectual-property laws. You may view and share links to the Site for personal,
          non-commercial use, but you may not reproduce, republish, or redistribute its content without prior written
          permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">5. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          You agree to use the Site only for lawful purposes and not to attempt to disrupt, overload, or gain unauthorised
          access to the Site or its underlying systems.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">6. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The Site is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. To the fullest extent permitted by law, Built
          Brilliant disclaims all warranties and shall not be liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of, or
          reliance on, the Site or its content.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">7. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We may update these terms from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page, and the "Last updated"
          date above will be revised accordingly. Continued use of the Site after changes are posted constitutes
          acceptance of the updated terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">8. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Questions about these terms can be directed to{' '}
          <a
            href="https://builtbrilliant.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="font-medium text-brand-700 underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
          >
            Built Brilliant
          </a>
          .
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
